{title: Yad Lagla}
{artist: Sairat Ajay Atul}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [E],        yaad laagal ga yaad laagal ga
[F] [G],        rangal tujhyat yaad laagal ga
[Am] [E],        vaas hyo usaat yei kasturicha
[F] [G],        chakhlaya vaar gwaad laagal ga
[C] [G],        chaand bhasato disaach maavlaya laagal
[C] [G],        aas laagali manaat kaalvaya laagal ga
[Am] [E],        yaad laagal ga yaad laagal ga
[F] [G],        rangal tujhyat yaad laagal ga
[Am] [E],        vaas hyo usaat yei kasturicha
[F] [G],        chakhlaya vaar gwaad laagal ga
[Am] [G],        sangvana bolvana man zurtay durum
[Dm] [E],        palataya taltay valtay maag firun
[Am] [G],        sajal ga dhajal ga laaj kaajal saaral
[Dm] [E],        yendhal he gondhalal laad laad gel harun
[C] [G],        bhalal as uraat paalvaya laagal
[C] [G],        odh laagali manaat chalvaya laagal
